WEBVTT

00:12:26.332 --> 00:12:31.078
considering this 7,000-year journey
from enzymes in cheese making

00:12:31.102 --> 00:12:33.355
to the present day and enzyme design.

00:12:33.689 --> 00:12:35.570
We're really at a creative crossroads,

00:12:35.594 --> 00:12:39.856
and with enzymes,
can edit what nature wrote

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:42.413
or write our own stories with amino acids.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:46.041
So next time you're outdoors
on a muggy night

00:12:46.065 --> 00:12:47.478
and you see a firefly,

00:12:47.502 --> 00:12:49.136
I hope you think of enzymes.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.533
They're doing amazing things for us today.

00:12:51.557 --> 00:12:53.160
And by design,

00:12:53.184 --> 00:12:55.714
they could be doing
even more amazing things tomorrow.

00:12:55.738 --> 00:12:56.889
Thank you.

00:12:56.913 --> 00:12:58.944
(Applause)